    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a great BBQ \ud83c\udf56 master! Cook delicious BBQs in nature with friends up to 5 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/111dc9a16f1fd316b78fe3935083f9d0.avif?t=1750950398\" width=411 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56<strong>Step-by-step</strong> creation of barbecue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56 <strong>Variability</strong> of recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/6cde616f860bb561b1a21db56be835b4.poster.avif?t=1750950398\" width=640 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/6cde616f860bb561b1a21db56be835b4.webm?t=1750950398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/6cde616f860bb561b1a21db56be835b4.mp4?t=1750950398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56 You will\u00a0<strong>smell</strong> the BBQ through the monitor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56  You can <strong>kick</strong> annoying friends who are talking about simple things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the art of creating barbecues from many different ingredients: even take rabbit meat and marinate it in bananas in soy sauce! (It's joke)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And by the way, don't forget to enjoy the BBQ itself after cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a great BBQ \ud83c\udf56 master! Cook delicious BBQs in nature with friends up to 5 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/111dc9a16f1fd316b78fe3935083f9d0.avif?t=1750950398\" width=411 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56<strong>Step-by-step</strong> creation of barbecue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56 <strong>Variability</strong> of recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/6cde616f860bb561b1a21db56be835b4.poster.avif?t=1750950398\" width=640 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/6cde616f860bb561b1a21db56be835b4.webm?t=1750950398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3148010/extras/6cde616f860bb561b1a21db56be835b4.mp4?t=1750950398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56 You will\u00a0<strong>smell</strong> the BBQ through the monitor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf56  You can <strong>kick</strong> annoying friends who are talking about simple things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the art of creating barbecues from many different ingredients: even take rabbit meat and marinate it in bananas in soy sauce! (It's joke)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And by the way, don't forget to enjoy the BBQ itself after cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Barbecue with Friends&quot; is a multiplayer simulator of BBQ cooking. You will prepare ingredients and marinades, tend to the coals, and grill BBQ! You'll also be able to put out the flames with water, marinate the meat, skewer a friend, and enjoy a beer!",
